WEBVTT

00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:23.458
The time for revenge has come.

00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:47.375
Lord Yagyu!

00:00:47.375 --> 00:00:50.417
So what about him?

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:53.792
He's gotten a hold of a woman who has the
power of the Bodhisattva Eye or something,

00:00:53.792 --> 00:00:56.417
and he seems to be plotting something.

00:00:56.417 --> 00:00:58.792
Let him do as he likes.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:02.542
Are you sure about that?

00:01:02.542 --> 00:01:05.708
It's worth watching,

00:01:05.708 --> 00:01:08.625
to see how the Vessel reacts.

00:01:12.792 --> 00:01:14.917
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:20.000
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:27.417
<i>Tsukiakari no shita de...</i>

00:01:27.417 --> 00:01:30.125
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:34.958
<i>...yakusoku wo kawashita</i>

00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:39.792
<i>Gozen reiji hoeru you ni sasayaite</i>

00:01:39.792 --> 00:01:45.250
<i>Chinmoku to zattou no naka</i>

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:50.375
<i>Kuruisou de kowaresou na genjou kai</i>

00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:54.292
<i>Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite</i>

00:01:54.292 --> 00:01:58.208
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:01:58.208 --> 00:02:03.417
<i>Kamereon janakute</i>

00:02:03.417 --> 00:02:08.625
<i>Kokoro kara kawarou</i>

00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:12.292
<i>Kikoeru yo sono kotoba</i>

00:02:12.292 --> 00:02:18.833
<i>Subete no yoru ga akeru you ni sakebou</i>

00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:22.542
<i>Hageshisa to yasashisa de</i>

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:34.167
<i>Subete no yoru ga sakeru you ni sakebou</i>

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:47.208
It's quiet, huh?

00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:50.458
Sure is, nothin' at all going on around here.

00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:53.250
Well, I guess it's all right
though, wouldn't you say?

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.292
I don't like the feeling.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:04.875
Repeating the same thing again, eh?

00:03:06.375 --> 00:03:10.792
People just don't learn, do they?

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.958
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:03:16.958 --> 00:03:17.917
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Twelfth Night"

00:03:18.125 --> 00:03:19.917
"Revival of the Kozunu"

00:03:21.417 --> 00:03:24.500
So, ya think that guy will be all right?

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.167
He's not gonna bite it that easy.

00:03:27.167 --> 00:03:28.250
Sorry to trouble you though.

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:31.833
Hey, don't be such a stranger!
Call me anytime, man!

00:03:31.833 --> 00:03:35.417
Well, see ya round!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:57.167
Sure looks like you spent some time
somewhere workin' on your technique.

00:03:57.167 --> 00:04:00.792
Your batteries fully charged now
or something, ya lightning bastard?

00:04:00.792 --> 00:04:06.167
Looks like you people have gotten a little
better at using your powers too, simpleton.

00:04:06.167 --> 00:04:09.125
So, what'd you come strolling on back here for?

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:14.875
That's a heck of a way to talk to
someone who just saved your buddies.

00:04:14.875 --> 00:04:18.083
Don't worry, I don't have
any business with you guys.

00:04:18.083 --> 00:04:22.000
I just figured that if I followed you,
I'd be able to see him.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.292
"Him"?

00:04:23.292 --> 00:04:26.000
Oh, Houraiji!

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.000
Oh, hey.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.000
Um...

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.333
How's Tatsuma doing?

00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:33.833
The doctor's examining him right now.

00:04:33.833 --> 00:04:37.292
It's all right. She says
his life is not in any danger.

00:04:55.792 --> 00:04:57.083
Here.

00:04:58.083 --> 00:04:59.417
You doing okay?

00:04:59.417 --> 00:05:03.792
Thanks, you sure you're okay being out this late?

00:05:03.792 --> 00:05:06.458
Well, I'm worried too.

00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:14.958
Oh...

00:05:20.708 --> 00:05:23.292
So? What's the story, old bag?

00:05:23.292 --> 00:05:27.458
You want me to make it so
that you'll never speak again?

00:05:27.458 --> 00:05:29.792
How is he doing?

00:05:29.792 --> 00:05:32.250
I'm pretty impressed actually.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:38.250
Any of these injuries would have been
fatal if he hadn't just barely dodged each.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:41.125
You know, you've always been lacking for brains,

00:05:41.125 --> 00:05:45.792
but you do at least have an
eye for finding guys like this.

00:05:45.792 --> 00:05:47.875
Could it be primal instinct at work?

00:05:47.875 --> 00:05:49.375
Can it!

00:05:49.375 --> 00:05:51.000
What a relief!

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.250
Yes.

00:05:53.667 --> 00:05:55.292
What's the deal?

00:05:55.292 --> 00:05:58.042
What were even the two of you doing there?

00:05:58.042 --> 00:06:00.167
How do we answer that?

00:06:00.167 --> 00:06:02.750
Um, how should I put this?

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.958
Allow me to explain that.

00:06:05.958 --> 00:06:08.750
Master! Why?

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:11.500
Old Man White Moth... Master Ryuzan!

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:12.458
Huh?

00:06:12.458 --> 00:06:15.750
You're Kisaragi's... It has been a while.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:18.292
And you seem as well as ever, Iwayama.

00:06:18.292 --> 00:06:20.458
I have no need for flattery.

00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:25.667
Kisaragi? And Doctor Iwayama too?

00:06:25.667 --> 00:06:28.083
So, you all know each other?

00:06:28.083 --> 00:06:31.333
Aw, cut to the chase, will ya?

00:06:31.333 --> 00:06:34.792
I really hate mysteries.

00:06:34.792 --> 00:06:38.917
Will you spit it out now or what, gramps?

00:06:58.833 --> 00:06:59.958
"Sakuragaoka Central Hospital"

00:06:59.958 --> 00:07:03.250
There is a certain individual
known as the "Bodhisattva Eye."

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:05.542
Bodhisattva Eye?

00:07:05.542 --> 00:07:09.458
This person has the power
to read the Dragon Stream

00:07:09.458 --> 00:07:13.875
and thereby select the chosen from
all creation and lead them to salvation.

00:07:13.875 --> 00:07:19.792
However, at the same time,
this person is also a source of conflict.

00:07:19.792 --> 00:07:26.208
Receiving that power is akin to receiving
the very power of the Dragon Stream.

00:07:26.208 --> 00:07:29.750
If you can manipulate the Dragon Stream at will,

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:34.167
then bringing the world under
your control would be no great effort.

00:07:34.167 --> 00:07:37.917
Since antiquity, battles over the Bodhisattva Eye

00:07:37.917 --> 00:07:41.833
have erupted among those
in power countless times.

00:07:41.833 --> 00:07:44.167
So, what are you getting at?

00:07:45.292 --> 00:07:51.125
It is said that the one who holds the
Bodhisattva Eye has a certain power.

00:07:51.125 --> 00:07:53.458
"A certain power"?

00:07:53.458 --> 00:08:00.042
To rejuvenate the power of life:
the power of healing, so to speak.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.583
It can't be!

00:08:04.583 --> 00:08:08.208
Aoi... Aoi's the Bodhisattva Eye?

00:08:10.125 --> 00:08:15.125
The healing powers of the Bodhisattva Eye
are on an entirely different level from my own.

00:08:15.125 --> 00:08:20.458
The Bodhisattva Eye can not only heal
injuries, it can restore the dead to life,

00:08:20.458 --> 00:08:27.500
as well as instantly advance the age
of a person until that person dies.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:30.792
The Eight-Hands-Breadth Sword
that they stole is an instrument

00:08:30.792 --> 00:08:34.500
that greatly intensifies
the Bodhisattva Eye's powers.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:38.958
It is one of what are
called the ten sacred treasures.

00:08:38.958 --> 00:08:41.875
"Ten sacred treasures"?

00:08:41.875 --> 00:08:44.708
If it's one of the ten
sacred treasures, that means...

00:08:44.708 --> 00:08:47.750
Our enemy has already obtained the other nine.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:52.167
On one occasion we located
and tracked him down.

00:08:52.167 --> 00:08:53.375
However...

00:08:53.375 --> 00:08:55.792
He was more than a match for you, eh, gramps?

00:08:55.792 --> 00:08:57.625
Kyouichi!

00:08:57.625 --> 00:09:00.958
It's all right, that is the truth.

00:09:00.958 --> 00:09:05.167
The Bodhisattva Eye appears
when the Dragon Stream is disrupted.

00:09:05.167 --> 00:09:09.292
Wait! If Tendo Kozunu was
causing the demonic incidents

00:09:09.292 --> 00:09:13.292
in order to disrupt the Dragon Stream, then...

00:09:13.292 --> 00:09:20.625
Right, it was all to awaken
the Bodhisattva Eye in her, in Aoi.

00:09:22.125 --> 00:09:24.417
So, does Aoi know about all that?

00:09:24.417 --> 00:09:29.958
Dunno. Why don't you tell her
yourself, Doom 'n Gloom, ya bastard?

00:09:35.292 --> 00:09:36.917
What is this?

00:09:39.708 --> 00:09:44.083
You told her. You told Aoi, didn't you?

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:50.750
Idiot! If you told her about
something like that, Aoi would...

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:54.292
Why?! Why did you tell her?!

00:09:57.958 --> 00:10:01.500
That wasn't all you did either, was it?

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:05.458
What is it? What the hell did you do to Aoi?!

00:10:07.125 --> 00:10:08.958
I tried to kill her.

00:10:13.458 --> 00:10:17.125
The Bodhisattva Eye...
The one with the Bodhisattva Eye

00:10:17.125 --> 00:10:20.000
will bring doom upon this world.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:23.083
With that being the case,
I sought to kill her before...

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.792
You stinking...

00:10:42.583 --> 00:10:43.792
Sakurai!

00:10:43.792 --> 00:10:46.125
Stop! Stop it!

00:10:46.125 --> 00:10:51.083
Why?! Why, dammit?!
Why the hell would anyone have to kill Aoi?!

00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:55.750
It's not her fault she was born
with a power like that, is it?!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:59.292
It's not Aoi's fault that those
demons appeared either!

00:10:59.292 --> 00:11:05.375
Aoi said we should protect people.
She said we should do all that we can.

00:11:05.375 --> 00:11:08.708
At first, I wondered why she was saying all that.

00:11:08.708 --> 00:11:11.625
But... But you know...

00:11:13.292 --> 00:11:19.833
A person like you would
never be able to fight like Aoi!

00:11:25.625 --> 00:11:27.042
Komaki...

00:11:29.083 --> 00:11:31.167
That's enough, Komaki.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:42.583
Those were your grandfather's
orders, weren't they, Kisaragi?

00:11:42.583 --> 00:11:44.125
Yes...

00:11:44.125 --> 00:11:48.958
Just like the Kisaragi, I and the Oribe
sisters here are descendants of those

00:11:48.958 --> 00:11:54.542
who have defended the land of Edo,
this city of Tokyo, down through the ages.

00:11:57.833 --> 00:12:00.792
We each have our own missions.

00:12:00.792 --> 00:12:05.292
It is the mission of the Kisaragi
to kill the Bodhisattva Eye.

00:12:05.292 --> 00:12:08.458
But then what about Aoi?

00:12:17.958 --> 00:12:21.542
There, good girl.

00:12:21.542 --> 00:12:24.167
I love your eyes.

00:12:24.167 --> 00:12:28.333
Oh, so you <i>can </i>be strong with women,
as long as it's a doll you're dealing with?

00:12:28.333 --> 00:12:31.833
You're one to talk, when you're
a puppet on someone else's strings.

00:12:31.833 --> 00:12:34.875
Have you finished running
errands for your master yet?

00:12:34.875 --> 00:12:38.500
Don't you dare make fun of him.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.833
"Him," huh?

00:12:42.292 --> 00:12:44.292
Well, no matter.

00:12:44.292 --> 00:12:47.125
Time to go, Aoi.

00:12:47.125 --> 00:12:52.625
Kisaragi, I will now tell you and the others

00:12:52.625 --> 00:12:56.292
about how this all began.

00:13:00.083 --> 00:13:05.250
Mother! Mother!

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:08.792
M-Mother!

00:13:11.958 --> 00:13:16.167
The house of Kozunu launched a coup d'etat.

00:13:16.167 --> 00:13:20.125
The reason for this was that the shogunate
attempted to kidnap one of their daughters

00:13:20.125 --> 00:13:23.792
who had been born with the Bodhisattva Eye.

00:13:23.792 --> 00:13:27.292
In order to protect the girl,
the Kozunu made use of the Dark Arts

00:13:27.292 --> 00:13:31.458
and started to rebel against the Shogunate.

00:13:32.958 --> 00:13:34.208
Then...

00:13:34.208 --> 00:13:37.708
It means the Shogunate is originally
to blame for starting this fight.

00:13:37.708 --> 00:13:38.917
And we've also...

00:13:38.917 --> 00:13:41.958
I never knew that until now, Master Arai.

00:13:41.958 --> 00:13:45.792
That's how it is. There's no
"good" fighting or "bad" fighting.

00:13:45.792 --> 00:13:50.667
Even that fight was just
a struggle for power after all.

00:13:52.125 --> 00:13:53.958
Hey, Kisaragi.

00:13:54.875 --> 00:13:58.417
You still gonna kill Aoi?

00:14:02.625 --> 00:14:06.500
That fight ended in defeat for the Kozunu.

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:10.875
Decades later, their descendants again
raised an army during the Bakumatsu,

00:14:10.875 --> 00:14:14.542
but were again defeated.

00:14:14.542 --> 00:14:18.000
Since that time, the Kozunu
have hidden their lineage,

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:22.292
and lived in the shadows of history,
unbeknownst to anyone.

00:14:22.292 --> 00:14:27.375
I don't know the full details myself,
but they escaped their pursuers,

00:14:27.375 --> 00:14:32.333
and continued to evade people like us
after the Meiji Restoration as well.

00:14:32.333 --> 00:14:38.792
That man who calls himself Tendo Kozunu
must have lived quite a life indeed.

00:14:52.208 --> 00:14:54.792
I don't believe you're Kozunu!

00:14:54.792 --> 00:14:58.250
You concealed your identity
and snuck into our family!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.708
And gave birth to a child no less!
How utterly disgusting!

00:15:04.458 --> 00:15:07.625
Mother!

00:15:09.625 --> 00:15:11.333
Mother...

00:15:15.583 --> 00:15:19.125
I think I can kind of understand.

00:15:20.917 --> 00:15:22.792
Tatsuma!

00:15:22.792 --> 00:15:25.125
--Hiyu!
--Hiyu!

00:15:26.167 --> 00:15:28.917
Oh, Hiyu!

00:15:28.917 --> 00:15:31.667
Moron, don't be going overboard like that!

00:15:31.667 --> 00:15:32.958
Sorry.

00:15:32.958 --> 00:15:36.000
How are your injuries? Do they still hurt?

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.083
Nah, thanks.

00:15:40.625 --> 00:15:45.458
He tried to see inside my mind.

00:15:46.375 --> 00:15:48.875
"He"? You mean Kozunu?

00:15:49.958 --> 00:15:54.125
But I felt it when he did.

00:15:54.125 --> 00:15:59.208
I felt the deep, intense sadness
that's dormant inside him.

00:16:02.125 --> 00:16:06.667
I want to save him too,
to save the soul of Tendo Kozunu.

00:16:06.667 --> 00:16:08.958
Don't give me that shit!

00:16:08.958 --> 00:16:11.958
Save him? Get outta here!

00:16:11.958 --> 00:16:13.917
That guy...

00:16:13.917 --> 00:16:17.792
He's the only one I'll never forgive!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:25.500
I thought I told you; we fight to protect.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.625
But look at what he did to Hirasaka.

00:16:27.625 --> 00:16:31.792
Right, I couldn't save a person like him.

00:16:33.042 --> 00:16:34.875
Misato also...

00:16:37.125 --> 00:16:42.417
Misato also wants that. I'm sure of it.

00:16:42.417 --> 00:16:44.458
Hiyu?

00:16:44.458 --> 00:16:47.083
Jeez, you're one stupid son of a bitch.

00:16:47.083 --> 00:16:49.792
I'm sorry, Kyouichi, but...

00:16:49.792 --> 00:16:51.167
All right already!

00:16:51.167 --> 00:16:52.458
Huh?

00:16:52.458 --> 00:16:56.042
According to the old bag, I'm an idiot too.

00:16:56.042 --> 00:16:59.792
So, that means we're the perfect dynamic duo.

00:16:59.792 --> 00:17:01.583
Kyouichi!

00:17:03.708 --> 00:17:07.542
Good grief, primal instinct indeed!

00:17:08.917 --> 00:17:10.208
"Totoriki Park"

00:17:10.208 --> 00:17:14.292
So, what's that bastard trying to do?

00:17:14.292 --> 00:17:16.250
Most likely...

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:19.083
Hey, whatcha doing now?

00:17:19.083 --> 00:17:23.167
This very ground is a Kozunu grave.

00:17:23.167 --> 00:17:24.958
Huh?

00:17:24.958 --> 00:17:30.708
My ancestors, who were defeated by
the Shogunate, committed suicide here.

00:17:30.708 --> 00:17:36.417
Those of the Kozunu line have
continued to sleep here ever since,

00:17:36.417 --> 00:17:38.958
never having been granted a proper burial.

00:17:38.958 --> 00:17:40.750
What do you mean?

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:48.500
I will now resurrect that bloodline,
the bloodline of my ruined family!

00:17:52.458 --> 00:17:53.375
...the heck was that?

00:17:53.375 --> 00:17:54.500
What was that just now?

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:55.917
You heard something?

00:17:55.917 --> 00:17:57.750
Did you?

00:17:58.583 --> 00:18:01.917
Come now to those who serve
and venerate you at this shrine;

00:18:01.917 --> 00:18:05.375
we implore you, hasten, heal our ills.

00:18:05.375 --> 00:18:10.375
Mirror of the Deep, Mirror of the Shore,
Eight-Hands-Breadth Sword,

00:18:10.375 --> 00:18:13.375
Jewel of Life, Jewel of Perfection,

00:18:13.375 --> 00:18:17.292
Jewel of Resurrection,
Jewel of Warding, Snake-Repelling Scarf,

00:18:17.292 --> 00:18:21.583
Bee-Repelling Scarf,
Scarf of Multifarious Protection...

00:18:28.583 --> 00:18:31.083
Revival of the Kozunu clan?!

00:18:31.083 --> 00:18:32.625
Misato!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:53.542
Looks like it's started.

00:19:53.542 --> 00:19:56.792
You don't have a second to lose.
You've got to bring Aoi back.

00:19:56.792 --> 00:19:59.375
Easy enough for you to say,
but where the heck is she?

00:19:59.375 --> 00:20:00.833
Master...

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:04.417
Doctor Iwayama!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.417
I can hear her.

00:20:08.417 --> 00:20:11.000
I can hear Misato crying.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.958
Sagaya, you dirty...

00:20:13.958 --> 00:20:19.375
I think I can trace the path of Misato's mind.

00:20:19.375 --> 00:20:22.708
I'm concerned about him, so I'll go too.

00:20:22.708 --> 00:20:24.708
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:20:25.958 --> 00:20:30.667
Misato saved me.

00:20:30.667 --> 00:20:34.208
This time, I'll return the favor!

00:20:34.208 --> 00:20:36.917
Sure, we've gotta save her.

00:20:42.917 --> 00:20:48.000
I wasn't able to protect you, but...

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.042
What'll you do?

00:20:57.042 --> 00:20:59.500
You still intent on killing her?

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:01.500
That is my mission.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:04.125
Oh, your mission, huh?

00:21:04.125 --> 00:21:08.000
Well, if that's what you're bent
on doing, I won't try to stop you.

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:12.583
But when it comes down to it,
I'm the one you'll be facing off against.

00:21:12.583 --> 00:21:15.208
I'll protect her; you'll see.

00:21:18.083 --> 00:21:21.958
I'm going to kill him. I guarantee it.

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:25.125
I won't let you.

00:21:35.958 --> 00:21:38.167
Master, what is this?

00:21:38.167 --> 00:21:40.417
The demons...

00:21:40.417 --> 00:21:44.250
It seems the demons' spirits have wandered out.

00:21:54.667 --> 00:21:57.667
What're you... Not at a time like this!

00:21:57.667 --> 00:22:00.083
